<title>USA: CytRx Corp names Mark Reynolds as CFO.</title>
<headline>CytRx Corp names Mark Reynolds as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>CytRx Corp on Friday said Mark W. Reynolds has been named chief financial officer and corporate secretary, in addition to his duties as corporate controller.</p>
<p>Reynolds replaces James Yahres, who has been named vice president of investor relations.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
